--|---|\n| **APM** | Packaging | Reproducible, governed distribution of agent context | Org-wide skill/MCP-server rollout to all contributors regardless of IDE | High | Policy engine, lockfile integrity, SBOM, broadest agent coverage (8) | Newest governance features unproven at scale; MS stewardship | **USE** | Pharaoh methodology, Spec Kit, `mcp-servers`, `sbom-tool` |\n| **Lola** | Packaging | Same, lighter-weight | Small-team or pilot skill sharing | Medium | Simpler, vendor-neutral, OpenSSF badge | No lockfile hashes, no policy/SBOM, narrower agent coverage | **WATCH** (fallback only) | same as APM's list |\n| **OKIT** | Packaging | Minimal skill copying | Personal prototyping only | Low | Zero dependencies, auditable | No versioning/security/marketplace, bus factor 1 | **DO NOT USE** | none at this maturity |\n\n## Recommendations\n\n### Packaging Layer\n- **Primary:** APM (policy engine, lockfile integrity, SBOM export, broadest coverage)\n- **Fallback:** Lola (simpler, vendor-neutral)\n- **Not recommended:** OKIT (pre-production, bus factor 1)\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. Execute proof-of-concept pilots for recommended primary tools\n2. Validate integration with existing S-CORE infrastructure (Bazel, Sphinx, sphinx-needs)\n3. Measure governance and audit outcomes\n4. Update this ADR with results from pilot deployments\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-score/score/issues/comments/5128938558/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"aryansingh0012","id":237943152,"node_id":"U_kgDODi65cA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237943152?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansingh0012","html_url":"https://github.com/aryansingh0012","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansingh0012/followers","followi